{"title":"2026 INMO","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The 40th <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Indian_National_Mathematical_Olympiad\" title=\"Indian National Mathematical Olympiad\">Indian National Mathematical Olympiad</a> 2026 was held on 18th January 2026.  The first link below contains all problems, and the rest of the links contain them individually.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_INMO_Problems\" title=\"2026 INMO Problems\">Entire Test</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_INMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2026 INMO Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_INMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2026 INMO Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_INMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2026 INMO Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_INMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2026 INMO Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_INMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2026 INMO Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_INMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2026 INMO Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_INMO&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competitions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competitions\">Mathematics competitions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competition_resources\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competition resources\">Mathematics competition resources</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Math_books\" class